# The blanket `coverage/` rule above (earlier in this file) must never hide the
# first-party gate tooling: re-include the tools/coverage directory and its contents,
# then re-exclude only the generated c8 report directory inside it.
!tools/coverage/
!tools/coverage/**
tools/coverage/coverage/
